  "details": "Hello, last month I have updated my avatar project from 2019.4.31f1 to 2022.3.6f1, it was without issues and I did some avatar updates, uploaded and it was fine. Today I opened the project, got an error already while opening and after that I got this error messages in Unity.\n\nI get the same error even if I create completely new 2022 avatar project using VRC companion. \n\nOld 2019 projects are working, 2022 not. After opening 2022 project, I have only one option in VRC SDK menu \"reload SDK\" but this button is not doing anything.\n\nIs this some issue related to latest updates? I had VRC SDK 3.5.1 and I got this error, so I updated it to 3.5.2 but it's still the same.\n\nCan you please check? Thanks",
